Repost from G+/Facebook/Twitter:

So, I tell you what! We are holding a DESIGN CONTEST! We need designs for 
t-shirts and stickers to sell on our new market place. It really *should* be 
in Lojban, but go ahead and surprise us if you want. The top three winning 
designers will receive an LLG logo sticker (the cartesian-venn logo) 
courtesy of the LLG. All profits go directly to the LLG which in turn goes 
to supporting the folks working on finishing the revised CLL, other 
LLG/BPFK projects, and various expenses for our annual convention, Logfest 
(coming up on the 7th and 8th of July in San Mateo, California. We have 
plenty of room if you want to come!). Submit designs by email to 
thelogicallanguagegroup@gmail.com or post links in the comments below! 

